# Assembly: one's DAOs; in each DAO its proposals; a screen for each proposal to vote and decide on.

SCREEN Home:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST DAOs: "Alice is a member of Bob's Delos" OPENS Dao
    LIST People: EVERYONE WITH knows, listed OPENS Person
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Found: Alice may found Delos under a new name of hers, Delos TYPED

SCREEN Dao ABOUT "Alice is a member of Bob's Delos":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Delos: steward, listed
    LIST Proposals: "Alice holds Prop of Delos" WITH passed, rejected OPENS Proposal
    Propose: Alice may make the proposal Prop to Bob's Delos, Prop TYPED
    Propose own: Alice may make the proposal Prop to Alice's Delos, Prop TYPED

SCREEN Proposal ABOUT "Alice holds Prop of Delos":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW: proposed, vote_for, vote_against, voted, decided, passed, rejected, delivered, delivered_vote, delivered_decision
    Vote for: Alice may vote for Prop of Bob's Delos, Bob FROM member
    Vote against: Alice may vote against Prop of Bob's Delos, Bob FROM member
    Vote own for: Alice may vote for Prop of Alice's Delos
    Vote own against: Alice may vote against Prop of Alice's Delos
    Pass: Alice may pass Prop of Delos
    Reject: Alice may reject Prop of Delos

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, listed
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Carol FROM knows
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Bob to Carol, Carol FROM knows
    Join: Alice may admit Bob to Delos, Delos FROM steward
